WEBVTT

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.370
Natsume, I've baked some cookies.

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:08.370
Would you like to...

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.470
<i>I wonder where she's gone.</i>

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:44.320
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:03.440
<b>Episode 10:  For Whom Do the Stars Fall</b>

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:02.890
Yuuri-san!

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:04.790
What is it, Gojouin?

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:08.100
Have you made any progress 
with your maid since last time?

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:20.570
<i>I haven't told Gojouin anything 
after the help she gave me.</i>

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:25.320
I was able to tell Lilith that I love her.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:27.430
Finally!

00:02:27.430 --> 00:02:29.310
It finally happened!

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:31.220
Congratulations!

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:31.860
Yeah.

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:32.930
And then?

00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:34.960
And then what happened?

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:36.140
What did she say?

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:37.790
What are your plans now?

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:42.170
I imagine things must have 
changed quite a bit since then!

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:44.760
What's changed?

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:49.620
We have a new member of the family.

00:03:06.550 --> 00:03:08.740
I see. So that's what you meant.

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:09.940
Yeah.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:13.240
The mansion's been quite a 
bit livelier, thanks to her.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:16.430
But it seems she doesn't 
think very highly of me.

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:18.240
Does she really not?

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:21.500
I want to be friends with Natsume, though.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:26.130
She loves Lilith, too, after all.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:36.520
That is most definitely... a rival in love!

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:40.160
So cold...

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:42.820
What's taking that brat so long?

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:47.600
Finally, he's here.

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:52.660
<i>Who's that?</i>

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.510
<i>W-Wait...</i>

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:58.520
<i>Does he have a secret girlfriend, 
even though she said she loves Lilith?</i>

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:00.920
<i>I will never approve of this!</i>

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.640
<i>I should definitely take Lilith home!</i>

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:09.910
She's a necessary part of any love story!

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:15.650
This is the kind of messy drama that I love!

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:20.080
A former love and a new love...

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:23.030
A damsel's heart wavering between the two...

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.620
Yes! More of this!

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:29.880
This is getting fun!

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:32.150
Young lady, I've come to pick you up.

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:34.360
We're leaving.

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:37.000
But it was just getting good!

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:49.500
<i>W-Wasn't that the one famous for being 
the worst student at the academy,</i>

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.070
<i>Fujisaki-senpai?!</i>

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:53.740
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:56.540
<i>What if she thinks I'm 
picking a fight with her?</i>

00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:58.800
Natsume?

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:00.130
Y-Yes?

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:02.040
How may I help you?

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:04.770
I haven't seen anything.

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.630
What are you doing out here?

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.650
I'm here to take you home.

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:17.490
Oh. She's just a classmate?

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:20.130
What else would she be besides a classmate?

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:22.950
Y-You're still a kid. 
You don't need to know yet.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.960
Anyway, why did you come today?

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.670
Well, y'know...

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:35.490
It's because I'm thinking 
of going home soon.

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:37.670
So I just wanted to say goodbye.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:41.030
Oh... You're leaving?

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:44.110
Gonna be lonely?

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:46.100
I won't be lonely.

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:47.840
You're such a brat.

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:51.300
S-So, anyway...

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:53.510
It's Christmas soon, right?

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:56.780
Do you know what Lilith wants?

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:57.530
Hey.

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:00.280
Watch where you're going.

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:01.670
Damn it.

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:03.170
You'd better pay.

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:05.800
<i>He's getting himself in trouble!</i>

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.130
You were the ones who bumped into me.

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:12.790
S-Say that again!

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:15.420
Do you have proof that we bumped into you?

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:17.740
There's no proof that I 
bumped into you, either.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.640
Damn brat...

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:21.470
Do you know who you're dealing with?!

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:29.580
Aren't you embarrassed, 
getting so mad at a kid?

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:32.370
Huh? This is none of your business. Piss off!

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:33.030
Hm?

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:37.320
Th-That's not what we...

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.710
We're sorry!

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:42.450
Hey.

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:46.710
You talked back to those high schoolers.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:47.580
Good going.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.910
But don't put yourself in too much danger.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:54.300
You'll make Lilith worry.

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:57.620
You're right. Sorry.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:59.680
Thanks for helping me.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:02.460
You were awesome, Natsume.

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:03.810
It was nothing.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:07.160
I know! Let me do something to thank you.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:09.060
Huh? Thank me?

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:10.690
I don't need that.

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:11.820
Why not?

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:14.280
You saved me from getting into trouble.

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:15.980
So I want to thank you.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:19.390
I don't know what to say to that.

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:21.830
Okay...

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:25.300
There's something I want 
your help with, then.

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:31.830
Natsume?

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:35.010
Did you go out to pick up the young master?

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:37.590
Yeah, I figured why not, for a change.

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:41.600
You could have told me, then.

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:45.900
Well, we'd better get going.

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:47.440
Let's go, Natsume.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:49.120
R-Right.

00:07:54.230 --> 00:07:57.640
<i>Something seemed off about those two.</i>

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:59.230
How many times do I have to tell you?!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:02.540
What?! This is obviously the better one!

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:03.970
No, no!

00:08:03.970 --> 00:08:08.090
Lilith's childlike charm is part 
of what's so attractive about her!

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:11.820
No freaking way!

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:15.990
It's her grown-up, 
mature side that's so awesome!

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:23.570
I'm glad they're getting along better.

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:26.940
Is something the matter?

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:28.690
Er, no.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:31.390
Anyway, I'm not here to argue with you.

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:35.830
You said you wanted me to 
help you choose a gift.

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:41.580
So anyway, back to our discussion.

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:44.340
A surprise?

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:45.410
Yeah.

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:48.990
We're putting together a Christmas 
party without telling Lilith.

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:50.580
Why is it a secret?

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:52.470
Isn't it obvious?

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:56.080
We're going to keep it a secret, 
and surprise her on the day of.

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:59.460
That makes sense.

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:01.620
It's a deal.

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:10.450
I'm going to tell Lilith that I've been 
invited to Gojouin's Christmas party.

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:15.270
And I'm going to take her out, then bring 
her back to the mansion in time.

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:20.080
<i>That way, I can figure out what 
she wants while we're out, too.</i>

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.710
<i>Two birds with one stone.</i>

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:29.390
O-Oh, yeah, Christmas is coming up soon, huh?

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:30.660
It is.

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:33.660
It's hard not to be excited about 
Christmas, for some reason.

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:35.800
Young master, about our plans for the day...

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:41.750
Sorry, Lilith, I've been invited to 
a party at Gojouin's for Christmas.

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:45.690
Is that true, young master?

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:47.850
Yeah.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:50.930
I'm going to be having 
dinner at her place, too.

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:53.650
I see.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:58.530
L-Lilith, why don't the two of 
us go out on Christmas, then?

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:00.830
Okay. Thank you.

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:06.600
Young master, please enjoy 
Gojouin-sama's party.

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:08.280
Yeah...

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:23.310
<i>I need to at least give him a present.</i>

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:29.740
<b>Atel

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:29.730
Is what you just said true?

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:32.310
Yeah. Would you and—

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:34.940
By all means, I'd love to join!

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:36.060
<i>She's so close.</i>

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:38.220
A Christmas surprise...

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:40.110
That's a great idea!

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:43.520
I've read plenty of books on the subject.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:48.030
First, you're going to need 
to do something romantic.

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:52.530
A helicopter ride for a 
view of the nightscape...

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:55.710
Rent out a ship for a dinner cruise...

00:10:56.430 --> 00:10:59.980
And the finale is in a bathroom with 
rose petals floating in the bathtub,

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:02.520
candles to set the mood,

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:05.790
and a Chambery and Christmas cake toast!

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:10.340
Then the two share words of love, and...

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:14.870
I-I don't think I get it, but thanks.

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:21.090
I'm sorry, I lost control of myself.

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:24.070
So, what exactly are your plans?

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:28.050
Actually, I wanted to 
talk to you about that.

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:33.500
Are you really going to 
be all right on your own?

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:35.000
I'll be fine.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:38.640
I've been to Gojouin's house lots 
of times. I know how to get there.

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:40.080
But...

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:42.400
C-Come on, Lilith.

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:44.870
You heard him.

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:45.850
Yes.

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:50.800
Please be sure to contact me if you 
need anything, okay, young master?

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:52.780
Yeah. Got it.

00:11:57.460 --> 00:12:00.060
That about does it for the first mission.

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:01.120
Now we just...

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:09.610
Where's the target?

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:12.890
We've successfully taken her out.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.200
Hello, Fujisaki-san.

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:17.270
Good day.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:22.180
My young lady has informed 
me of the situation.

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:25.710
With respect, I will be directing the party.

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:27.710
Do I have permission from the both of you?

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:30.210
Yes. Please and thank you.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:33.000
Then, first, young lady...

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.690
Okay! Tell me what to do!

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:42.850
Why am I the one making the decorations?!

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:44.860
Done.

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:46.120
Indeed.

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:48.960
Now we just need to decorate it, and it's done.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:52.690
Yuuri-sama, please hold still for a moment.

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:55.840
Pardon me.

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:58.310
You had some whipped cream on your nose.

00:12:58.700 --> 00:12:59.890
Thanks.

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:02.450
You're very thoughtful, Fujisaki-san.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:06.720
No, I'm just used to doing these 
kinds of things for the young lady.

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:09.710
The young lady is rather clumsy.

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:11.240
I have to keep an eye on her, or...

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.290
Is something the matter?

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:17.020
No, I just realized the two of 
you really do love each other.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:18.780
L-Love?

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:20.100
Yeah.

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:22.190
I kind of envy you.

00:13:27.670 --> 00:13:28.890
I'm confiscating this.

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:33.170
But it's such a rare pairing!

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:38.950
Making memories to keep is important, isn't it?

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:41.420
Yeah, it is.

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:44.040
Hey, Fujisaki...

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:48.550
I'd like to help cook, too.

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:56.050
Then, young lady, could you please 
put the strawberries on the cake?

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.640
I can do that!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.450
<i>C-Crap...</i>

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:11.420
<i>I'm getting nervous.</i>

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:14.660
<i>What are you supposed to talk 
about in these situation?</i>

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:17.680
<i>I know. I'll Kookle it.</i>

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.590
First time out together conversations
<u>Conversations Can Make or Break a First Date
 Is It a Date if You Go Out Together? Conversation Expert Explains
Signs That They like You Back</u>

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:26.420
<u>Date Plans for Your First-Time Meeting
 No Conversation Topics? No Problem! Perfect Dating Spots
 [Relationship Quiz] Places to Go Before You're Going Steady</u>

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:29.120
<i>It's totally useless.</i>

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:31.890
Is something the matter, Natsume?

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:34.660
Huh? No, uh...

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.810
<b>Delicious
Crêpes</b>

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:40.530
Let's have crêpes.

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:42.180
I'll go buy some.

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:44.050
Wait here, Lilith.

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:47.190
Natsume! You shouldn't run, or...

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:50.690
Natsume!

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:52.560
Are you all right?

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:54.560
I-I'm fine.

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:56.710
You aren't fine at all!

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:02.530
<i>I look so stupid.</i>

00:15:03.510 --> 00:15:04.610
Natsume.

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:06.770
Please use this. I soaked it in water.

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:08.710
Thanks.

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:12.670
<i>O-Okay.</i>

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:13.910
<i>Now's my chance.</i>

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:17.810
<i>I need to apologize for my embarrassing 
behavior and for everything that's happened.</i>

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:20.820
L-Lilith... About today—

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:22.270
Thank you for everything 
you've done for me today.

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:27.680
You invited me out thinking 
I might be depressed, right?

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.410
I wasn't really...

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:33.310
Are you okay with this, though?

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:36.540
There must have been someone you 
wanted to spend the day with.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.200
H-Huh?!

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:39.750
Why would there be?!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.680
Is that so?

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:45.680
I saw the Christmas special in 
the magazine you were reading.

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:48.460
I thought there was someone 
you had feelings for.

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:51.560
Th-That was y—

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:53.690
Never mind.

00:15:57.990 --> 00:16:01.020
Let's enjoy the day, Natsume.

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:02.670
Of course we will!

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:17.890
I'm so glad.

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:19.460
It looks good on you.

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:24.310
These cutesy things suit you better.

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:26.120
That's not true.

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:28.470
You're very cute, Natsume.

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:32.680
You're so embarrassing.

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:35.170
Thanks.

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:36.730
You're welcome.

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:42.240
Natsume?

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:45.380
Lilith... I have something for you, too.

00:16:45.380 --> 00:16:46.600
Here.

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:50.080
May I open it?

00:16:57.510 --> 00:17:03.650
I was planning to figure out what you
might like and buy it today, but...

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:09.400
I'm thinking of going back 
to the mansion soon.

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:13.760
So you'd better use it to write 
me a letter once in a while.

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.490
I will. I promise.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:25.960
Thank you, Natsume.

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:31.110
<i>Huh?</i>

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:33.620
<i>I didn't think they'd keep it so dark.</i>

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:43.110
Look at this, Lilith!

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:44.340
Huh?

00:17:45.720 --> 00:17:48.220
<i>Oh, no! Is she inside already?</i>

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:52.450
Merry Christmas!

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:55.840
Huh? Lilith...

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.290
What about the surprise?

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:58.510
What's going on?

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:01.740
Sorry we didn't tell you.

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:02.970
The truth is...

00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:05.650
Young master?

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:08.610
What's the matter? It's so late.

00:18:12.380 --> 00:18:14.290
I see.

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:16.600
So that's what you've 
been doing with Natsume.

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:17.890
Yeah.

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:20.330
We wanted to surprise you.

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:24.080
But I couldn't keep a 
secret from you, Lilith.

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:27.030
I have to apologize to 
Natsume tomorrow, too.

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:28.270
Young master...

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:30.780
Sorry to bug you so late.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:37.470
Just a moment, young master.

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:42.860
I just came up with a great idea to 
make sure we don't disappoint Natsume.

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:49.740
So I was the one who was being 
surprised, and you were...

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:56.410
What's wrong with you?

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:58.650
Are you all right?

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:00.830
F-Fujisaki-senpai?!

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:04.540
H-H-H-Hello!

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:07.810
Come on, Natsume-san.

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:09.970
I'm sure you've got a lot to say.

00:19:09.970 --> 00:19:12.200
Please come in.

00:19:12.680 --> 00:19:14.420
Yeah, you should.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:17.850
Let's go, Natsume.

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:52.930
Thank you for your help today.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:54.160
Not at all.

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:56.870
The young lady seems to 
have enjoyed it, as well.

00:19:58.010 --> 00:20:01.850
Fujisaki in a mini-skirt Santa outfit...

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:07.640
Thank you for all your work today, Yuuri.

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:11.840
I hope you'll continue being 
young Tsukasa's friend.

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:13.630
Of course.

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:16.490
I hope you come by again, too, Fujisaki-san.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:20.290
Well, then...

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:33.370
Young master, you did fantastic today.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:35.330
Thanks to you, too, Lilith.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:37.370
That was an impressive act.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.210
Thank you.

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:45.800
Did you pick out Natsume's 
hair accessory, too?

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:46.800
Yes.

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:48.720
It suits her well, doesn't it?

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:49.720
Yeah.

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:51.760
I'm sure she appreciated it.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.900
What about you, young master?

00:21:03.270 --> 00:21:06.390
Lilith, how do I do this part?

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:10.410
Pass the needle under this knot.

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:24.900
I hope Natsume likes it.

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:27.670
Yes, I'm sure she will.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:40.980
To Natsume:
Thank you{missing}!
Merry Christmas
-Yuuri

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:24.000
